{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/104647-crossover-possibility","id":104647,"title":"Crossover possibility","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-02T23:39:20-07:00","id":104647,"title":"Crossover possibility","content":"Will it be possible to crossover with<br /> <br /> The oWoD ?<br /> The NWoD ?<br /> The 3E Exalted ?<br /> Scion (hay they be based on the same base ST system) ?<br /> <br /> The Reason I ask is because I read the unfinished online Trinity Storyteller Handbook and it aired the subject i regard to oWoD and possible 1e or 2e Exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T00:05:56-07:00","id":104666,"title":"","content":"I had it happen in my Aberrant game (Tesla was involved...). Crossed over with OWoD. There's a power in the Aberrant Player's Guide called Crosstime Travel, which can do exactly that with the right Extra applied to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T01:52:49-07:00","id":104701,"title":"","content":"Note that Trinity Continuum and Scion are both using flavors of a new OPP house system. This will interfere with crossovers, in that there will now be additional mechanical concerns to deal with in addition to the usual setting and story concerns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T07:16:51-07:00","id":104798,"title":"","content":"The Trinity Continuum:<br /> <br /> - Uses a wholly new mechanical system from the WoDs and Exalted<br /> - Is owned by a different company<br /> <br /> Odds of any sort of official crossover are very close to zero.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T07:19:46-07:00","id":104801,"title":"","content":"Can we ask how possible it would be to run Scion-Trinity crossovers?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T08:33:43-07:00","id":104845,"title":"","content":"I think at this point, it would be prudent to specify: are we talking about a &quot;hey, the beer is warm, the pizza is cold, and I've got this fun idea&quot; crossover, or a &quot;officially supported&quot; crossover?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T08:38:31-07:00","id":104848,"title":"","content":"Well, I dropped the use of the Epic Attributes system as written and decided to use the Mega-Attribute system instead so it is possible for my game to cross over. We even joked about how the deities were actually high Quantum rated novas and the Scions are all second generation novas coming into their power. The Titans are just high Taint novas and the deities were those who sought to keep Taint low.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T16:05:36-07:00","id":105155,"title":"","content":"I suspect that players wishing to do so wouldn't have any mechanical problems doing a Trinity Scion crossover. Unless you're doing a stuff with alternate universes colliding I'm not so sure that it would make a whole lot of sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T19:19:55-07:00","id":105309,"title":"","content":"We\u2019ve been warned that just because both Trinity and Scion are using the same house system as a basis, we shouldn\u2019t expect them to be compatible with each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T20:04:58-07:00","id":108879,"title":"","content":"So, what if a powerful nova used Universe Creation to make the world of Scion? He imagined them all into being. And then, as he sank deeper and deeper into dementia, he used it again to make the Wyld of Exalted and then he and his buddies jumped into it as the Primordials?<br /> I think that my players are in for some wild rides now.<br /> Any one else tried to do this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T20:13:58-07:00","id":108884,"title":"","content":"I heard it suggested, but as either Exalted or Scion rather then both, particularly with Divis Mal becoming Malfeas (oh I get it <b>Mal</b>feas, I just got it!), and one suggested he instead was the Unconquered Sun.<br /> <br /> But it does fit somewhat, Primordials do seem like Beyonders, and Abberant can make their own Universe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T20:31:22-07:00","id":108900,"title":"","content":"I haven't tried having Aberrants CREATE those worlds, though I did once have my Aberrant players use a variation of the Crosstime Travel power to be flung into the Old World of Darkness (Tesla devices from the Adventure! age were involved...). Oh, those Novas and Mages had a grand ol' time trying to explain each other...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T22:12:32-07:00","id":108973,"title":"","content":"@Eldagusto I have heard those same theories. I think that novas doing all of it sounds great.Creating all of the various Storyteller universes. It would make for a great thing to do to players. Especially those who start out in one of the other ones and then are brought over to the Aeoniverse (any setting in it). Let it all sink in to them.<br /> <br /> @lustral_star Yeah, I imagine the Mages (&quot;I can bend reality with my very will, but if I go too far, then shit happens to me.&quot;) and the novas (&quot;I can do anything I damn well please to realisty. But when I go too far, then I go all bug eyed and purple and start to see things.&quot;) would have a wonderful conversation. lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T23:05:40-07:00","id":109010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thedonnie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/104647-crossover-possibility?p=108973#post108973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Eldagusto I have heard those same theories. I think that novas doing all of it sounds great.Creating all of the various Storyteller universes. It would make for a great thing to do to players. Especially those who start out in one of the other ones and then are brought over to the Aeoniverse (any setting in it). Let it all sink in to them.<br /> <br /> @lustral_star Yeah, I imagine the Mages (&quot;I can bend reality with my very will, but if I go too far, then shit happens to me.&quot;) and the novas (&quot;I can do anything I damn well please to realisty. But when I go too far, then I go all bug eyed and purple and start to see things.&quot;) would have a wonderful conversation. lol</div> </div> </div> </div>That happened, too, but mostly the conversations were centered around either, &quot;I can see that you, too, warp the fabric of reality, but I can't detect the presence of any form of Node in brain... I mean, you obviously have some form of Aberrations (Paradox Flaws)...&quot; or, &quot;HOLY ----, YOU HAVE A QUINTESSENCE FOUNTAIN IN YOUR HEAD!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T23:25:45-07:00","id":109023,"title":"","content":"rofl. Yeah. As a thought exercise, my friends and I thought about a battle between a Solar and a nova. But then, he tried to go &quot;The Exalt uses Essence and the nova uses Quantum.&quot; and it did not click to him that both were the very energy of what makes up everything in the universe. <br /> As long as no one goes &quot;My energy source is different than what works here.&quot; If you go by literal interpretation, then no. If you do a simple &quot;this = this&quot; then things work out. If not? Then you have powers that are useless and people have no defense against other powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T07:25:13-07:00","id":109272,"title":"","content":"In our thought experiments along the same lines, we wound up equating Essence with Noetic Energy. Which made the hypothetical battles even MORE explodey.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T07:59:28-07:00","id":109298,"title":"","content":"thanks for the replies","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}